<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- First Boston cuts Galicia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- First Boston cuts Galicia.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut Banco de Galicia SA to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock is listed as on the Nasdaq.  </p>
<p>-- Last week Bear Stearns said it had cut its rating on Galicia to neutral from attractive.</p>
</text>
